<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 36, background: '#3D7BD9' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>内容三：VLM 语义接口与开放词汇查询</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#B9CCEA' }}>02 · Method 03</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 598, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 28, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 62, padding: '0px 20px', background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '3px solid #D9534F', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>先澄清一个关系　</span>内容一不用分割网络判定"动没动"，是为了对训练集外物体不失效；内容三的 VLM 回答的是"<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>是什么</span>"，服务开放词汇查询与导航目标指定。<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>两者服务不同问题，语义只作融合中的弱先验，不接管动态判定。</span>
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, marginTop: 14, height: 404 }}>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1.25, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 24px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 16 }}>三步把语言挂到高斯基元上</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>①</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 5 }}>异步语义标注，不进跟踪主循环</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>VLM 与开放词汇模型只在关键帧上批量产出特征，前端 30 Hz 跟踪完全不等待——避免把 VLM 的推理时延拖进实时环路。</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>②</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 5 }}>挂载到基元并压缩，控制体积</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>每个高斯携带语义向量；512 维 float32 约 2 KB，是几何参数 44 B 的 46 倍，故用乘积量化码本压到 64 维，并只做增量更新。</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>③</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 5 }}>语义作为第四支弱证据，反哺融合</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>类别与置信度并入贝叶斯后验，权重刻意压低：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>几何决定"动没动"，语义补上"是什么"</span>，避免语义先验主导而丢掉对未知物体的鲁棒性。</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 0.75, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 24px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 4 }}>验收口径</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginBottom: 14 }}>对应子问题 Q3 的三项指标</Text>

        {[
          { k: '查询召回', v: '≥ 0.80', d: '开放词汇检索命中率' },
          { k: '单次查询', v: '≤ 100 ms', d: '文本 → 三维区域的响应' },
          { k: '体积增长', v: '≤ 1.3 倍', d: '挂语义相对纯几何地图' },
        ].map((it, i) => (
          <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'column', paddingBottom: 12, marginBottom: 12, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>{it.k}</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>{it.v}</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>{it.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        ))}

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>当前进度　</span>码本压缩原型已跑通，尚未接入完整评测集；语义场完成度约 40%。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 14, padding: '12px 24px', background: '#E8EFF8', height: 76 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>选型结论　</span>VLM 定位为"离线标注 + 在线检索索引"，不当在线感知器用。依据是近一年 24 篇 VLM 工作里 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>14 篇未落地到 3D 表示、19 篇靠 LLM 蒸馏致时延过大</span>，直接接入实时建图环路不可行。
      </Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 50, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>动态环境下视觉语言模型辅助三维高斯语义建图与机器人目标导航</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>12 / 26</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
